<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-31T13:43:48+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Mon, 31 Aug 2026 13:43:48 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[He worked as the green ranger in 'Power Rangers', then used the experience to rob 43 homes as the 'Spider-Man thief']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133646629.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After suffering an injury, Yasutomo Ihara—a former Green Ranger stunt performer—found himself lured into a life of crime. He became notorious for orchestrating multiple burglaries across Japan, employing his unique skills. Authorities arrested Ihara in 2014, discovering he had stolen items worth around seventy-seven thousand dollars. Consequently, he was sentenced to five years in prison for these offenses.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/he-worked-as-the-green-ranger-in-power-rangers-then-used-the-experience-to-rob-43-homes-as-the-spider-man-thief/articleshow/133646629.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/he-worked-as-the-green-ranger-in-power-rangers-then-used-the-experience-to-rob-43-homes-as-the-spider-man-thief/articleshow/133646629.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T13:32:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133646791,imgsize-145780.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Zohran Mamdani look-alike contest draws hundreds in New York]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133646581.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-zohran-mamdani-look-alike-contest-draws-hundreds-in-new-york/articleshow/133646581.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-zohran-mamdani-look-alike-contest-draws-hundreds-in-new-york/articleshow/133646581.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T13:32:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133646814,imgsize-197706.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Melinda Gates doubles Olivia Rodrigo's festival fund to $20M: Where will it go?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133645819.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Olivia Rodrigo's first-ever Daisy Chain Fields Festival has come to a triumphant end, bringing in significant funding to aid women-focused initiatives. This remarkable event showcased a variety of female performers who united for a common purpose. Rodrigo revealed plans to donate a large sum to ten women-centered charities, with Melinda French Gates promising to match the total amount, reinforcing the festival's mission to empower women and girls around the globe.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/melinda-french-gates-donated-10-million-to-olivia-rodrigos-daisy-chain-fields-festival-bringing-the-total-to-20-million-heres-where-the-money-will-be-going/articleshow/133645819.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/melinda-french-gates-donated-10-million-to-olivia-rodrigos-daisy-chain-fields-festival-bringing-the-total-to-20-million-heres-where-the-money-will-be-going/articleshow/133645819.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T12:57:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133645850,imgsize-965640.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[San Antonio storm cuts power and damages homes, but barber moves outside and keeps working]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133643197.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A powerful storm hit San Antonio’s West Side, knocking down trees, damaging homes and leaving more than 112,000 customers without power at its peak. As residents cleaned up and struggled with the heat, Misfit barbershop owner Juan Martinez moved his barber chair outside and continued serving customers despite the power outage.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-san-antonio-storm-knocked-out-power-and-damaged-homes-one-barber-simply-moved-his-chair-outside-and-kept-cutting-customers-hair/articleshow/133643197.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-san-antonio-storm-knocked-out-power-and-damaged-homes-one-barber-simply-moved-his-chair-outside-and-kept-cutting-customers-hair/articleshow/133643197.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T12:57:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133644122,imgsize-112993.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Venezuela will be reborn': Maduro shares first photos from US prison since capture]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133645345.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/venezuela-will-be-reborn-maduro-shares-first-photos-from-us-prison-since-capture/articleshow/133645345.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/venezuela-will-be-reborn-maduro-shares-first-photos-from-us-prison-since-capture/articleshow/133645345.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T12:40:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133645598,imgsize-65590.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Did US military warn Hegseth over Iran war strain before latest escalation? What report claims]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133642370.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/did-us-military-warn-hegseth-over-iran-war-strain-before-latest-escalation-what-report-claims/articleshow/133642370.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/did-us-military-warn-hegseth-over-iran-war-strain-before-latest-escalation-what-report-claims/articleshow/133642370.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T12:00:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.t